JxpwZXS8rbgsP_8LPJQhinh3tbS18bALdTw6D80w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDPBuFxWndGtMSCr-rjYa7E9HeeD4JU-7iThL24xwLZ-w&oe=6A4D071A"}, "display_name": "Intulect", "keywords": ["Nursing", "Education", "Simulation", "Healthcare", "Medical"], "long_description": "Intulect\u2019s AI-powered VR Nursing Simulations provide scalable, immersive, and competency-based training for nursing students and hospital systems. Our platform leverages AI to moderate and assess clinical simulations, eliminating the need for live facilitators while ensuring realistic, high-quality training experiences.\n\nKey Features:\n- AI-Moderated Simulations \u2013 Nursing students engage with AI-driven patients and scenarios, allowing for self-guided, competency-based learning without requiring an instructor to be present.\n-Real-Time Performance Tracking \u2013 Automated grading and analytics provide educators with detailed insights into student decision-making and competency development.\n-Scalable Clinical Practice \u2013 Institutions can expand simulation access without increasing costs, making hands-on training more accessible to students.\n-High-Fidelity Patient Interactions \u2013 AI-driven patients respond dynamically, improving critical thinking, prioritization, and communication skills.\n-Seamless Integration \u2013 Designed to fit into nursing curricula, our simulations enhance theoretical learning, lab practice, and clinical training.\nWith Intulect, nursing programs and hospital systems can provide flexible, cost-effective, and data-driven training solutions, better preparing nurses for real-world challenges.", "short_description": "Where Training Becomes Instinct. Intulect is an AI-Facilitated Nursing Simulation Platform to improve clinical preparedness for all level of learners in healthcare. "}]}, "developer_name": "Intulect", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://intulect.com/policies/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publ